  "prefLabel": "Ph 302.05 NH MPJE Examination Required Scores and Fees",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-04-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 302.05 NH MPJE Examination Required Scores and Fees.\n\n(a) To successfully complete the examination required by Ph 302.03(f), the candidate shall, in the initial examination or any subsequent re-examination, obtain a score of not less than 75.\n\n(b) The candidate shall pay the current examination fee to, and as assessed by, NABP.\n\nSource. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96; ss by #6933, eff 2-1-99, EXPIRED: 2-1-07\n\nNew. #10702, INTERIM, eff 10-23-14, EXPIRED: 4-21-15\n\nNew. #11031, eff 1-29-16",
